32	 * A link shared in a chat or on a timeline is rendered from the tags of
33	 * the page it points at, and an image is the part of that card a reader
34	 * sees first. The image is drawn from the project rather than shipped
35	 * with the generator, so every site previews as itself, and it is drawn
36	 * in the palette of the site it belongs to.
37	 *
38	 * Drawing needs the gd extension with FreeType support. Without it a run
39	 * writes no image and the pages carry no image tag, because a card that
40	 * names an image the site does not serve is worse than a card without
41	 * one.
42	 */
